and after three  months way after the hype surrounding  nuke city had passed a complete and  total information blackout on the  episode was put into place essentially  wiping this episode of family guy from  the minds of the general public through  the use of mass amnestization tactics  unlike those with mcfarland interviews  with the cast and crew of family guy  revealed that they believed that  scp-5981 was entirely real and that the  episode would shine light on a  lesser-known tourist destination while  mcfarland claimed that he had just came  up with a concept for the show while  under hypnosis the man revealed that he  had been approached by an individual  wearing all black robes and a  cone-shaped hood prior to the episode's  conception this entity instructed  mcfarland to produce an episode  revolving around a nuclear town where in  its climax a resident would be murdered  by being pushed into a nuclear reactor  mcfarland could not recall anything else  about this memory when brought back from  hypnosis still the foundation continued  to monitor for incidents revolving  around  scp-5981 while still some tried to visit  the city these events were far and few  between a few notable events include a  civilian who did not return from  scp-5981  but whose family was sent a letter from  nuke city hospital explaining that they  had been killed in a motorcycle accident  while touring the city another involved  a heavily injured civilian returning  from scp-5981  after an altercation with a street gang  their blood revealed traces of  irradiated nuclear radiation yet no ill  effects aside from those received in the  street gang beatdown were noted another  incident involved the television channel  cartoon network receiving a tape  containing an entire season of a cartoon  revolving around three mutated dogs in  their lives which was being pitched by  radioactive studios a company supposedly  located inside  scp-5981 the final incident involved  several u.s politicians visiting  scp-5981  and accidentally being caught in an  explosion that occurred as a result of a  janitor pushing a plant worker inside a  nuclear reactor in the city's main power  plant much like what occurred in the  episode this resulted in an explosion  that destroyed a massive portion of  scp-5981  the foundation could do nothing but  cover up the politicians deaths and  increase security outside of scp-5981's  entrance the case of scp-5981  is certainly mysterious and gives very  little answers but it's definitely one  of the most unique anomalies that the  foundation has had to deal with keeping  true to the spirit of family guy let's  end with a cutaway gag holy crap viewer  this is just like the time dr bright  visited nuke city now go check out  scp-2316 the bodies in the water and  scp-1472 multiverse strip club for more  anomalous locations that are  brain-breakingly strange
 

